{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>騰訊控股發行總值18億美元，及260億元人民幣票據定價。</p><p></p><p>當中10年期13億美元票據，以及20年期5億美元票據，年利率都超過6厘。10年期200億元人民幣，及30年期60億元人民幣票據，年利率分別為2.4厘及3厘。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-14T01:39:02.260095+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":107,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"},"published_at":"2026-10-14T00:52:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-14T01:32:00.236334+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-14T01:32:00.236334+00:00","content_hash":"b78de225129253ea82ecd54a33ca516d521d4badddc15c4dc657a47208ca0586","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null}